{"product":{"id":9728669843681,"title":"WOODSMAN 100","body_html":"<p>The Woodsman 100 is our everyday directional ski: a 100mm all-mountain platform built to rip groomers, track through chop, and float in soft snow.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Woodsman 100 receives an updated flex profile that is stiffer underfoot and through the forebody. This adds torsional stiffness for better edge hold and more stability at speed. Signature Rocker adds float and forgiveness without giving up the ability to carve. The Bi-Radius Sidecut starts the turn quickly in the tip and holds it through a long, stable tail radius. A directional mount and supportive tail reward skiers who drive the front of the ski with damp, predictable performance across the whole mountain. This is the Woodsman for skiers who want one directional ski for the entire season on either coast.</p>\n<p>Every Woodsman 100 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, damp, and durable all-mountain ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:41-07:00","handle":"woodsman-100","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:52-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Stock Ski, Woodsman","variants":[{"id":49128509309153,"product_id":9728669843681,"title":"161cm","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PWD100161","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"161cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:41-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":4,"old_inventory_quantity":4,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_curr